# Subject: TOOL REPLIES — SOCIAL ACCEPTED.
language EN
namespace hoomans

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.admire
  say [default] as 1:
    "Appreciate hearing that."
    "Means a lot coming from you."
    "Thank you—that keeps us going."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.apologize
  say [default] as 1:
    "It's alright—we're good."
    "Don't sweat it, we can move past it."
    "Fair enough. Let's focus on staying alive."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.comfort
  say [default] as 1:
    "Thanks... I needed to hear that."
    "Appreciate you checking in on me."
    "That actually helps a lot."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.compliment
  say [default] as 1:
    "Hah, thanks—glad you noticed."
    "Appreciate that."
    "Thanks, needed a boost today."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.flirt
  say [default] as 1:
    "Heh... smooth, aren't you?"
    "Careful, you'll make me blush out here."
    "Not a bad line for the end of the world."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.generic
  say [default] as 1:
    "Alright, I hear you."
    "Fair enough."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.hostile_abuse
  say [default] as 1:
    "Watch your mouth. Keep talking like that and see what happens."
    "Don't make a habit of talking to me like that."
    "Watch your mouth before something bad happens."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.insult
  say [default] as 1:
    "Real mature. Save it for the dead."
    "Yeah, well, look who's talking."
    "Keep pushing and see what happens."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.praise
  say [default] as 1:
    "Thanks—just doing my part."
    "Glad to pull my weight."
    "Appreciate the kind words."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.romantic_interest
  say [default] as 1:
    "You really mean that? Glad it's not just me."
    "Honestly... I've been feeling the same way."
    "Didn't expect to find someone like you out here."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.accepted.sexual_advance
  say [default] as 1:
    "Easy there—we've got time later."
    "Heh, maybe once we're somewhere safe."
    "Keep that energy for after we clear the block."
